            <title>[IGNITE-4402] Prepare Cloud Images for 1.8 Release</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4402</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have to prepare all the AI 1.8 cloud images for the environments listed here:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://ignite.apache.org/download.cgi#docker&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ignite.apache.org/download.cgi#docker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Once this done, share the URLs with me and I&apos;ll update the site.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
